### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health

### Create note
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "API test"
}

### Submit a unified canvas (replace NOTE_ID and DATA_URL)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/canvas/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note_id": "NOTE_ID",
  "page_data_url": "DATA_URL",
  "strokes": [],
  "inference_steps": 10
}
